WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.567
Breaking news out

00:00:00.567 --> 00:00:01.901
of Jerusalem at this hour.

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:04.371
A final vote on that controversial bill.

00:00:04.371 --> 00:00:05.739
Part of the judicial system

00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:07.140
overhaul. CNN's Hadas

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.341
Gold is live for us

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:09.576
now with the very latest.

00:00:09.576 --> 00:00:11.511
So Hadas, the vote

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:12.178
we were talking about, the vote

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:13.079
moving up

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:16.416
a little more quickly than anticipated.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.052
Yeah, the vote has actually now passed.

00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:20.754
64 to zero.

00:00:20.754 --> 00:00:21.321
This vote

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:22.088
that will take away

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:23.223
the Supreme Court's ability

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:25.125
to stop government actions,

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:26.259
declaring them unreasonable

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:27.093
it has passed

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:27.494
the reason

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:29.229
it was 64 to zero votes

00:00:29.229 --> 00:00:31.231
because all the members of the opposition

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:34.134
left the floor in protest to this vote.

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:36.002
We are just outside the Supreme Court

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:36.936
organized us here

00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:38.338
have set up big screens

00:00:38.338 --> 00:00:39.572
so that protesters can see

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:41.107
what's happening on the parliament.

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:42.242
And you can hear that

00:00:42.242 --> 00:00:43.676
they are getting very loud

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:44.911
and they are actually all starting

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:45.712
to walk down

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:47.714
towards the parliament building.

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:48.915
They don't seem to be indicating

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:49.749
that they're going to be leaving

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:50.550
any time soon,

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:52.485
despite the fact that this passed.

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:52.919
It appears

00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:54.521
that all at times that last minute

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:56.322
negotiations failed

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:57.590
We know that there was lots of back

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:59.359
and forth with the coalition opposition

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:01.661
to try to negotiate potentially a delay.

00:01:01.661 --> 00:01:03.029
Those appear to have failed.

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:04.297
The government has managed

00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:05.932
to pass the first aspect

00:01:05.932 --> 00:01:07.667
of this massive judicial overhaul.

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:09.102
This isn't the only part

00:01:09.102 --> 00:01:10.036
of the judicial level.

00:01:10.036 --> 00:01:11.571
One bill of several

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:12.872
we're seeing on the screens

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:13.940
of what's happening on the parliament

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:15.275
for coalition members

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:16.276
congratulating each other,

00:01:16.276 --> 00:01:17.577
including Benjamin Netanyahu,

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:18.878
just out of the hospital

00:01:18.878 --> 00:01:20.580
actually for a pacemaker.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:21.381
That was just a tally.

00:01:21.381 --> 00:01:22.482
He literally left the hospital

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:23.249
this morning.

00:01:23.249 --> 00:01:24.751
They came straight to the parliament

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:26.386
when this vote passed out.

00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:28.088
This does not mean necessarily that

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:29.556
starting at this very moment,

00:01:29.556 --> 00:01:31.124
the Supreme Court cannot stop

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:32.092
government actions.

00:01:32.092 --> 00:01:33.827
There are still several steps

00:01:33.827 --> 00:01:34.661
that need to be taken.

00:01:34.661 --> 00:01:35.428
And ironically,

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:37.030
one of those steps is most likely

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:39.099
an immediate legal challenge

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:40.800
to this legislation,

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.335
which will ironically be heard

00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:44.237
in front of the Supreme Court, likely.

00:01:44.237 --> 00:01:46.139
Now, if the Supreme Court decides

00:01:46.139 --> 00:01:48.241
that this legislation cannot stand

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:50.043
because it is ironically

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:51.878
unreasonable in their eyes.

00:01:51.878 --> 00:01:52.445
Then we are

00:01:52.445 --> 00:01:53.046
set up here

00:01:53.046 --> 00:01:55.682
for a major political crisis

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:56.449
here for a country

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:58.551
that has no written constitution.

00:01:58.551 --> 00:01:59.352
That's partly

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:00.420
what's the issue here

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:02.021
now for these protesters.

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:03.389
This passing, this,

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:04.757
they believe, is the beginning

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:06.559
of the end of an independent judiciary.

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:08.228
This, they believe, is the beginning

00:02:08.228 --> 00:02:08.928
of government

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:10.330
having unfettered power

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:11.131
to do what it wants

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:12.465
because the Supreme Court

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:13.933
is the only check

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:15.335
on the government power here.

00:02:15.335 --> 00:02:16.936
I don't think that these protesters

00:02:16.936 --> 00:02:18.872
are going home anytime soon.

00:02:18.872 --> 00:02:19.472
I have a feeling

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:20.073
we're going to be in

00:02:20.073 --> 00:02:21.908
for a very eventful next

00:02:21.908 --> 00:02:22.575
few hours

00:02:22.575 --> 00:02:23.510
as these protesters

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:25.645
get potentially even more riled up.

00:02:25.745 --> 00:02:28.715
Guys had asked what will happen now

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:30.917
because Benjamin Netanyahu

00:02:30.917 --> 00:02:31.851
and those who supported

00:02:31.851 --> 00:02:33.786
it said the judiciary needed reform.

00:02:33.786 --> 00:02:34.821
It had too much power.

00:02:34.821 --> 00:02:35.455
Opponents say

00:02:35.455 --> 00:02:37.190
if you take away this soul

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:39.425
check on the government,

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:42.228
then you essentially have a dictatorship.

00:02:42.929 --> 00:02:46.199
So now exactly what happens once these

00:02:46.199 --> 00:02:47.867
bills pass then?

00:02:49.502 --> 00:02:50.803
So most likely will happen.

00:02:50.803 --> 00:02:51.638
We know the Israel Bar

00:02:51.638 --> 00:02:52.639
Association has said

00:02:52.639 --> 00:02:53.473
they're going to file

00:02:53.473 --> 00:02:54.407
an immediate petition

00:02:54.407 --> 00:02:55.708
in front of the Supreme Court.

00:02:55.708 --> 00:02:57.210
The Supreme Court can file

00:02:57.210 --> 00:02:59.312
an injunction, a temporary injunction

00:02:59.612 --> 00:03:01.080
stopping the legislation

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.849
from being in force.

00:03:02.849 --> 00:03:04.083
Now, that might happen.

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:05.618
We have a feeling that that will happen

00:03:05.618 --> 00:03:07.487
and then there will be a legal battle

00:03:07.487 --> 00:03:09.055
in front of the Supreme Court

00:03:09.055 --> 00:03:10.423
about whether this can stand.

00:03:10.423 --> 00:03:11.524
There's a lot of unanswered

00:03:11.524 --> 00:03:12.225
legal questions

00:03:12.225 --> 00:03:13.793
here, meddling questions here

00:03:13.793 --> 00:03:16.262
about what the legality of this will be.

00:03:16.462 --> 00:03:17.130
And I think also

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:17.864
in the more immediate

00:03:17.864 --> 00:03:18.731
will be, keep in mind,

00:03:18.731 --> 00:03:20.200
as thousands of military

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.534
reservists have said,

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:23.403
they will not heed the call to serve

00:03:23.403 --> 00:03:25.104
at this legislation passes.

00:03:25.104 --> 00:03:27.106
This legislation has now passed.

00:03:27.106 --> 00:03:28.241
So now we're going to see

00:03:28.241 --> 00:03:28.975
whether they're going

00:03:28.975 --> 00:03:30.143
to live up to that pledge

00:03:30.143 --> 00:03:30.476
or whether

00:03:30.476 --> 00:03:32.278
if they get called up for service,

00:03:32.278 --> 00:03:33.479
if something happens on the north

00:03:33.479 --> 00:03:34.013
with Lebanon,

00:03:34.013 --> 00:03:35.148
if something happens with Gaza,

00:03:35.148 --> 00:03:36.983
if something happens even with Iran,

00:03:36.983 --> 00:03:38.351
will they call up?

00:03:38.351 --> 00:03:39.652
Will they heed the call

00:03:39.652 --> 00:03:40.920
to get into their jets,

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.188
to get into their tanks

00:03:42.188 --> 00:03:43.590
and serve as board

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:45.225
as per their military reserve duty?

00:03:45.225 --> 00:03:46.159
And if they don't?

00:03:46.159 --> 00:03:47.126
Will they be arrested?

00:03:47.126 --> 00:03:48.561
Will that be legal ramifications

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:48.895
for that?

00:03:48.895 --> 00:03:49.929
These are all the questions

00:03:49.929 --> 00:03:50.930
now on the table,

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:52.899
because this legislation has now passed

00:03:53.967 --> 00:03:55.101
I was

00:03:55.101 --> 00:03:56.469
watching very closely Israel,

00:03:56.469 --> 00:03:58.438
of course, one of this country's

00:03:58.438 --> 00:03:59.239
closest allies.

00:03:59.239 --> 00:04:00.073
President Biden,

00:04:00.073 --> 00:04:02.242
of course, is very direct

00:04:02.642 --> 00:04:04.110
in where he stands on this

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:06.412
and what he thinks should happen.

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:09.916
Those words may have been heard,

00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:11.718
but it didn't certainly change anything.

00:04:11.718 --> 00:04:12.485
He does

00:04:13.853 --> 00:04:14.353
Oh,

00:04:14.988 --> 00:04:15.955
no, it didn't.

00:04:15.955 --> 00:04:17.357
And we've heard from President Biden

00:04:17.357 --> 00:04:19.192
now twice in the past week

00:04:19.192 --> 00:04:20.426
urging Netanyahu,

00:04:20.426 --> 00:04:21.761
urging Israeli leaders

00:04:21.761 --> 00:04:22.695
take a step back,

00:04:22.695 --> 00:04:24.297
take time to come to a consensus.

00:04:24.297 --> 00:04:27.033
There's
no need to rush this happen negotiation.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:28.368
But clearly, that pressure

00:04:28.368 --> 00:04:29.702
didn't seem to have much in effect.

00:04:29.702 --> 00:04:30.570
Remember, Benjamin

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:31.638
Netanyahu has not yet

00:04:31.638 --> 00:04:32.905
been invited to the White House,

00:04:32.905 --> 00:04:33.339
not been yet

00:04:33.339 --> 00:04:34.607
invited officially

00:04:34.607 --> 00:04:36.509
for that big White House visit.

00:04:36.509 --> 00:04:37.610
This judicial overhaul

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:40.046
was one of those potential reasons why.

00:04:40.246 --> 00:04:42.115
Now, we did hear from President Biden

00:04:42.115 --> 00:04:42.715
saying that

00:04:42.715 --> 00:04:43.916
they do it from the White House,

00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:44.851
saying that they do expect

00:04:44.851 --> 00:04:46.052
Netanyahu and Biden

00:04:46.052 --> 00:04:48.354
to meet sometime in the U.S. soon.

00:04:48.554 --> 00:04:49.322
Now, the question will be

00:04:49.322 --> 00:04:50.790
this legislation has passed.

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.492
There was no compromise negotiation.

00:04:52.492 --> 00:04:54.127
Will that invitation still stand?

00:04:54.127 --> 00:04:55.395
How will this affect

00:04:55.395 --> 00:04:56.963
us, Israel relationships?

00:04:56.963 --> 00:04:58.164
The Israelis have been saying

00:04:58.164 --> 00:04:59.432
for the longest time, you know,

00:04:59.432 --> 00:05:00.867
this is our own internal debate.

00:05:00.867 --> 00:05:01.734
This has nothing to do

00:05:01.734 --> 00:05:02.769
with the United States.

00:05:02.769 --> 00:05:03.569
Our partnership

00:05:03.569 --> 00:05:04.804
with the United States is strong,

00:05:04.804 --> 00:05:05.705
especially when it comes

00:05:05.705 --> 00:05:07.106
to security issues.

00:05:07.106 --> 00:05:07.940
There's a lot of questions,

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:08.708
though, now hanging,

00:05:08.708 --> 00:05:09.275
especially with all

00:05:09.275 --> 00:05:10.343
these military reservists

00:05:10.343 --> 00:05:11.711
saying that they will not serve.

00:05:11.711 --> 00:05:12.478
We have yet to hear,

00:05:12.478 --> 00:05:13.880
of course, from the White House

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:15.415
on this legislation passing

00:05:15.415 --> 00:05:16.449
since this has just happened

00:05:16.449 --> 00:05:17.550
in the last few minutes.

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:19.352
But it could very easily affect

00:05:19.352 --> 00:05:21.821
U.S., Israeli relations right now

00:05:21.821 --> 00:05:22.955
with all of this

00:05:22.955 --> 00:05:25.058
legal, political questions going on.

00:05:25.591 --> 00:05:26.125
Absolutely.

00:05:26.125 --> 00:05:26.793
Hadassah, really

00:05:26.793 --> 00:05:28.027
appreciate the reporting.

00:05:28.027 --> 00:05:29.362
So good to have you there on the ground.

